      "id": "add-nodes",
      "intro": "Node adalah blok bangunan rule deteksi Anda. Panduan ini menjelaskan cara menambah node ke canvas.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Cara Menambah Node",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **+ Condition** di toolbar bawah\n• **Drag** jenis node dari sidebar kiri ke canvas\n• Klik kanan di area kosong → **Add Condition**\n• **Double-click** di area kosong canvas",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\"><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:7px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600\">➕ + Condition</span><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:7px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600\">📥 Drag sidebar</span><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:7px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600\">🖱️ Klik kanan</span><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:7px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600\">🔄 Double-click</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Jenis-Jenis Node yang Tersedia",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **CONSTANT** — Cek nilai tetap (amount > 10jt)\n• **CONTAINS / IN_LIST / REGEX** — Cek string dan daftar\n• **VARIABLE / FREQUENCY / RATIO** — Cek nilai dinamis\n• **DEVIATION** — Cek penyimpangan dari normal\n• **LOGICAL** — AND/OR/NOT untuk menggabungkan kondisi",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3px\"><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600\">🔵 CONSTANT</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600\">📋 IN_LIST</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600\">🔍 CONTAINS</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600\">✳️ REGEX</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600\">📊 VARIABLE</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600\">⏱️ FREQUENCY</span></div></div>"
